<title>THAILAND: RESEARCH ALERT-Bank of Ayudhya rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Bank of Ayudhya rated buy.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asset Plus Securities Co Ltd on Tuesday reiterated its buy recommendation on Bank of Ayudhya Plc on expectations that the bank will manage earnings growth of between 0-5 percent in 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;We believe this is realistic given that BAY will be able to meet the BOT's (Bank of Thailand) new provisioning requirement with forecasted provisions,&quot; Asset Plus Securities said in a new report.</p>
</text>
